    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Cohere Command spans five catalog versions, released from 2024-08-30 to 2026-09-22. Across the whole family, one version supports reasoning and one publishes open weights, so most versions are API only and do not reason. Context windows run from 128000 to 256000 tokens, and all versions take image and text input and return text. The newest version, Command A+, offers 192000 tokens of context, 64000 max output, reasoning, and the lowest listed price at $0.3 input and $1.5 output per million tokens. Command A is the open weights option, with 256000 context but only 8192 output at $2.5 and $10. Command R7B is the cheapest older tier at $0.04 and $0.15. The family suits long document and image tasks, but output limits are tight on older versions and the priciest tiers are costly.",
